    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/05bb5b1486f2edf6a66c75c673f29446.poster.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/05bb5b1486f2edf6a66c75c673f29446.webm?t=1755188655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/d1657b47c954ea382b39bce98132da06.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online or Local</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with your friends online or local for up to 8 players for a space fight unseen before</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/09ea331f46c5c41f95ebf25e9816d22d.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/cbb12496180574d90b6acf26ae7c8620.poster.avif?t=1755188655\" width=1200 height=970 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/cbb12496180574d90b6acf26ae7c8620.webm?t=1755188655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/785c2e198e5a0013f27befc157255e34.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready for hilarious physics-based combat, punches, flying weapons, and EXPLOSIONS! Precision is optional, but chaos is guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/fa3b6c807e8f605ac0b4a998ea1ec08c.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/725b3c79b1ea80ccaba0f41ca5039f84.poster.avif?t=1755188655\" width=1200 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/725b3c79b1ea80ccaba0f41ca5039f84.webm?t=1755188655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/0707297e6d9ff92c209cf03b1a057cdf.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy space weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab it before they do! Use crazy space weapons to freeze, slow, blind, BLOW UP your enemies and many more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/abd111d3b3c7177d4924254cf6468200.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/ff347d833010f807d41c97b53fd7909f.poster.avif?t=1755188655\" width=1200 height=920 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/ff347d833010f807d41c97b53fd7909f.webm?t=1755188655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/7aee5ffa5b69dfaacae944e6d975d867.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awesome Jetpacks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did we say we have jetpacks? YES! Everyone gets one! Use it strategically to stay on the map, avoid hazards and surprises, all while you battle your friends up in deep space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/e5aedde3dab79efad577d4515e7f1748.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/4b517011e212421940acd0443ed1172e.poster.avif?t=1755188655\" width=1200 height=1106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/4b517011e212421940acd0443ed1172e.webm?t=1755188655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/596018f5b2087a86e6db657040798643.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action packed game modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your Strength\u00a0and your ability to stay on the map in <strong>Free For All</strong>, assert dominance and never let others take your place in <strong>King Of The Hill</strong> or run with the crown to take if for your own in <strong>Hold The Crown</strong>. Whichever you choose, FUN is guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/d77185f78730e1f56874bfe573254434.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/948b2262faa7b3a80d392eb46bd17dc8.poster.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/948b2262faa7b3a80d392eb46bd17dc8.webm?t=1755188655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/e0d78afc0fcd0aea7cc264e890f654f7.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dress to Impress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the point of winning if you don't look fabulous while doing it? Customize your character with wicked accessories to win the fashion contest and impress your friends before you beat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/2aad6c08fe72239e3401a5ce0f6bec7e.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p>",
