<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/d77185f78730e1f56874bfe573254434.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/948b2262faa7b3a80d392eb46bd17dc8.poster.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/948b2262faa7b3a80d392eb46bd17dc8.webm?t=1755188655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/e0d78afc0fcd0aea7cc264e890f654f7.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dress to Impress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the point of winning if you don't look fabulous while doing it? Customize your character with wicked accessories to win the fashion contest and impress your friends before you beat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603900/extras/2aad6c08fe72239e3401a5ce0f6bec7e.avif?t=1755188655\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p>",
